#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid "Strategies and Tips"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the game starts, the starting player should play any of the face up "
"cards from own stack. If the second player currently has face up cards that "
"are of the same suit as the card played, he/she has to reply with one of "
"those cards. If, however, the second player does not have a card of the same "
"suit, he/she can play with any other card. The player with the higher card "
"value* wins both cards. <note><title>Note</title><para>If the replying "
"player plays 'trump' card he/she wins both cards.</para></note> "
"<note><title>Note</title><para>If the leading player plays 'trump' card he/"
"she wins both cards.</para></note> The player who wins the round leads the "
"next one."
msgstr ""

